WEBVTT

00:00:59.555 --> 00:01:02.517
because this polarization
that we face today

00:01:02.558 --> 00:01:06.604
isn't just about believing
that the other side is factually wrong.

00:01:07.271 --> 00:01:10.900
We are beginning to see the other side
as malevolent beings

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:13.319
with a hateful and hidden agenda.

00:01:13.653 --> 00:01:15.154
And you can see this.

00:01:15.196 --> 00:01:18.866
You can see this in the screaming
cable news pundits,

00:01:18.908 --> 00:01:20.743
the politicians who vote down bills

00:01:20.743 --> 00:01:23.913
just because they come
from the other side of the aisle.

00:01:24.372 --> 00:01:26.707
The hate groups
that violently attack people

00:01:26.749 --> 00:01:29.001
who are different from themselves.